# Low index contrast: a large mode, and a regime where the semi-vectorial approximation is good.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: cladding index and slab index.
title Silicon nitride 1600 x 800 nm, quasi-TE
grid dx=0.05 dy=0.04
window width=6.0 ymin=-2.0 ymax=2.4
rect sin -0.8 0.8 0 0.8
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 1.835281890 2e-8
expect group_index 2.113997784 2e-6
expect confinement 0.898450042 1e-6
expect area 1.049371760 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 6600
expect neff_between 1.444 1.883557
